 debhelper-compat (= 13),
 guile-3.0,
 guile-3.0-dev,
 pkg-config,
 guile-library,
 guile-uuid,
 veritas
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://codeberg.org/jjba23/hygguile
Vcs-Git: https://codeberg.org/jjba23/hygguile.git
Vcs-Browser: https://codeberg.org/jjba23/hygguile
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: hygguile
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 guile-3.0,
 guile-library,
 guile-uuid
Description: Accessible server-rendered UI components for Guile Scheme
 Hygguile builds accessible, server-rendered user interfaces from
 S-expressions: components, layouts and helpers that emit HTML, so a Guile
 web application can render its pages without a JavaScript framework.
